<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We come forward by a new way,</l><l>Freshly cut and freshly slain,</l><l>To the Holiest of Holies;</l><l>Glorious access we obtain.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We come forward unto our God,</l><l>Who is sitting on the throne;</l><l>He has paved the way to glory</l><l>By His blood and cross alone.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We come forward to the new age,</l><l>With assured heart, true and bold.</l><l>To enjoy th’ eternal purpose,</l><l>Ne’er to shrink back to the old.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Praise You, Lord, we’ve all come forward.</l><l>Now within the Holiest,</l><l>You’re our God and we’re Your people;</l><l>Here we dwell forever blest.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
